# Base URL of the Uyir api-gateway, as reachable from the phone/emulator.
#   Android emulator -> http://10.0.2.2:8080
#   iOS simulator    -> http://localhost:8080
#   Physical device  -> http://<your-PC-LAN-IP>:8080
